{"id":"orationes.symbolum-apostolorum","title":"Symbolum Apostolórum","category":"orationes","section":"orationes-communes","variant":"devotional","sung":false,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":2,"about":{"pl":"Skład Apostolski jest starożytnym symbolem chrzcielnym Kościoła rzymskiego, tradycyjnie ujmowanym w dwunastu artykułach. W pierwszej osobie wyznaje wiarę w Boga Ojca, Jezusa Chrystusa i Ducha Świętego, a następnie w Kościół, odpuszczenie grzechów, zmartwychwstanie ciała i życie wieczne. Ta recenzja zachowuje powtórzone Credo przed artykułami o Duchu Świętym.","en":"The Apostles’ Creed is the ancient baptismal symbol of the Church of Rome, traditionally arranged in twelve articles. In the first person it professes faith in God the Father, Jesus Christ, and the Holy Spirit, and then professes the Church, forgiveness of sins, resurrection of the body, and everlasting life. This recension retains a repeated Credo before the articles concerning the Holy Spirit."},"ac":{"pl":[118],"en":[118]},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Credo","l":"credo","m":176},{"i":"w002","f":"in","l":"in","m":3,"h":"w003"},{"i":"w003","f":"Deum","l":"deus","p":",","m":35},{"i":"w004","f":"Patrem","l":"pater","m":162},{"i":"w005","f":"omnipoténtem","l":"omnipotens","p":",","m":96,"h":"w004"},{"i":"w006","f":"Creatórem","l":"creator","m":162},{"i":"w007","f":"cæli","l":"caelum","m":68},{"i":"w008","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w009","f":"terræ","l":"terra","p":".","m":64}],"tr":{"pl":"Wierzę w Boga, Ojca wszechmogącego, Stworzyciela nieba i ziemi.","en":"I believe in God, the Father Almighty, Creator of heaven and earth;"},"tc":{"pl":[114],"en":[115,116]},"g":{"pl":["wierzę","w","Boga","Ojca","wszechmogącego","Stworzyciela","nieba","i","ziemi"],"en":["I believe","into","God","the Father","almighty","Creator","of heaven","and","of earth"]},"fn":{"pl":{"w004":"Apozycja do „Deum” (w003): Bóg — Ojciec.","w006":"Druga apozycja do „Deum” (w003).","w009":"Wraz z „cæli” (w007) zależy od „Creatórem” (w006)."},"en":{"w004":"Apposition to “Deum” (w003): God — the Father.","w006":"A second apposition to “Deum” (w003).","w009":"Together with “cæli” (w007), depends on “Creatórem” (w006)."}}},{"id":"s02","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w010","f":"Et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w011","f":"in","l":"in","m":3,"h":"w012"},{"i":"w012","f":"Iesum","l":"Iesus","m":38},{"i":"w013","f":"Christum","l":"Christus","p":",","m":35},{"i":"w014","f":"Fílium","l":"filius","m":35},{"i":"w015","f":"eius","l":"is","m":27},{"i":"w016","f":"únicum","l":"unicus","p":",","m":96,"h":"w014"},{"i":"w017","f":"Dóminum","l":"dominus","m":35},{"i":"w018","f":"nostrum","l":"noster","p":":","m":96,"h":"w017"}],"tr":{"pl":"I w Jezusa Chrystusa, Syna Jego jedynego, Pana naszego,","en":"and in Jesus Christ, His only Son, our Lord:"},"tc":{"pl":[114],"en":[115,116]},"g":{"pl":["i","w","Jezusa","Chrystusa","Syna","Jego","jedynego","Pana","naszego"],"en":["and","into","Jesus","Christ","the Son","His","only","Lord","our"]},"fn":{"pl":{"w011":"Drugi człon zależny od „Credo” (w001).","w013":"Apozycja do imienia „Iesum” (w012).","w014":"Apozycja do imienia i tytułu „Iesum Christum”.","w017":"Kolejna apozycja do imienia i tytułu „Iesum Christum”."},"en":{"w011":"Begins the second complement governed by “Credo” (w001).","w013":"Apposition to the name “Iesum” (w012).","w014":"Apposition to the name and title “Iesum Christum”.","w017":"A further apposition to the name and title “Iesum Christum”."}}},{"id":"s03","type":"verse","w":[{"i":"w019","f":"qui","l":"qui","m":18},{"i":"w020","f":"concéptus","l":"concipio","m":245,"h":"w021"},{"i":"w021","f":"est","l":"sum","m":21},{"i":"w022","f":"de","l":"de","m":0,"h":"w023"},{"i":"w023","f":"Spíritu","l":"spiritus","m":100},{"i":"w024","f":"Sancto","l":"sanctus","p":",","m":101,"h":"w023"},{"i":"w025","f":"natus","l":"nascor","m":215,"h":"w021"},{"i":"w026","f":"ex","l":"ex","m":0,"h":"w027"},{"i":"w027","f":"María","l":"Maria","m":30},{"i":"w028","f"